{
  "transcriptVersion": 1,
  "id": "holders-add-to-account",
  "description": "Add a key-activated licence to an account (UK-42.11, WIRE-CONTRACT-V5 §12.3, §12.4, §12.5.1). The device activates by key and the licence is floating. The person signs in on it: authorize carries the hints (login_hint, name_hint, purpose attach) and license_choice=app, and the SDK redeems the code. The exchange answers a grant (status choose) instead of a token. The SDK completes with choice {kind: keep} and the device token, which keeps this device on its licence, and the answer names the same licence and the account's subject. attach({confirm:false}) previews the licence and writes nothing; attach({confirm:true}) adds it to the signed-in account (attached: claimed) with the same licence id.",
